369
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:09,750
and you keep the wrap.

370
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:11,840
They only release
so many at that

371
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,900
price.

372
00:10:12,900 --> 00:10:14,290
If it's still there,

373
00:10:14,290 --> 00:10:17,000
get one, and stop
